abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a master's thesis framework for functional
  verification of AI-agent-generated programs using intent structuring,
  program behavior analysis, rule-validated metamorphic testing, structured
  defect feedback, and iterative repair.
keywords:
  - AI Agent
  - Program Verification
  - Intent Structuring
  - Metamorphic Testing
  - Software Engineering
